            "value": "脚本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scripts are trusted local code with your user permissions. Keyestro copies installed scripts into managed storage and never interpolates arguments into a shell command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "脚本是以你的用户权限运行的受信任本地代码。Keyestro 会将已安装脚本复制到托管存储，且绝不会把参数插值到 shell 命令中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scripts are trusted local code with your user permissions. Managed copies are the default. Linked originals stay in place and must be reconfirmed after their file identity or contents change. Arguments are never interpolated into a shell command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "脚本是以你的用户权限运行的受信任本地代码。默认使用托管副本。链接的原始文件会留在原处；其文件身份或内容改变后必须重新确认。参数绝不会插值到 shell 命令中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
