            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作已提交。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This application has no bundle identifier.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用没有 Bundle Identifier。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clipboard image exceeds the 25 MiB limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此剪贴板图像超过 25 MiB 限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clipboard item exceeds the 2 MiB limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此剪贴板项目超过 2 MiB 限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This database was created by a newer Keyestro version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此数据库由更新版本的 Keyestro 创建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes all encrypted %@ clipboard items from this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从此 Mac 永久删除所有已加密的 %@ 剪贴板项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes all encrypted clipboard items from this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从此 Mac 永久删除所有已加密的剪贴板项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes all learned usage events from Keyestro's local database. Manual pins are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从 Keyestro 的本地数据库永久删除全部已学习的使用事件；手动固定项会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes encrypted clipboard item ID %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会永久删除 ID 为 %@ 的加密剪贴板项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes the quick link targeting %arg.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会永久删除目标为 %arg 的快捷链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes the selected encrypted clipboard entries from this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从此 Mac 永久删除所选的加密剪贴板项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently removes this extension's saved secret from the Keychain. The secret value is never shown in this confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从钥匙串永久移除此扩展保存的秘密；确认内容绝不会显示秘密值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the database, caches, clipboard history, managed scripts and extensions, Keychain keys, login item, and preferences. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会移除数据库、缓存、剪贴板历史、托管脚本与扩展、钥匙串密钥、登录项和偏好设置。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the saved value and notifies the extension that this exact preference is now unset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会移除保存的值，并通知扩展此项偏好设置现已取消设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This resets all non-secret Keyestro settings, including all shortcuts and privacy choices. Quicklinks, scripts, extensions, and their saved data are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会重置 Keyestro 的全部非敏感设置，包括所有快捷键和隐私选项；快捷链接、脚本、扩展及其保存的数据会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This resets all non-secret Keyestro settings, including both shortcuts and privacy choices. Quicklinks, scripts, extensions, and their saved data are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会重置 Keyestro 的全部非敏感设置，包括两个快捷键和隐私选项；快捷链接、脚本、扩展及其保存的数据会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This resets all non-secret Keyestro settings, including the launcher shortcut and privacy choices. Quicklinks, scripts, extensions, and their saved data are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会重置 Keyestro 的全部非敏感设置，包括启动器快捷键和隐私选项；快捷链接、脚本、扩展及其保存的数据会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This stops its entire process group and deletes all managed versions. External source files are not changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会停止其整个进程组并删除所有托管版本。外部源文件不会改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This window does not support that operation.": {
      "localizations": {
